{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Arithmetic_Series_Formula)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Arithmetic Series Formula)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Difference_of_Triangular_Numbers)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Difference of Triangular Numbers)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Answer_Choices,_Estimation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Answer Choices, Estimation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7_(Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7 (Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain!\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/b/52b7c0302334c2479fc27711255e27700bc631b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90+91+92+93+94+95+96+97+98+99=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"400\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eae02d4983bc8377fac845e001b10050d9bfeaf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 845 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 945 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1005 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1025 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1045$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"448\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearrange the terms to form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pairs, each of which sums to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/a/0da8ff1eb498a98f588d5167cbf270a7067c32a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$189$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/0/a507df93b78eb974ba012a76304108dda0f14d19.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 90+91+\\cdots +98+99 &amp;= (90+99)+(91+98)+(92+97)+(93+96)+(94+95) \\\\ &amp;= 189+189+189+189+189 \\\\ &amp;= 189 \\cdot 5 \\\\ &amp;=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 945} \\end{align*}\" width=\"657\" height=\"104\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewrite this sum as: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/2/98292b4ab54038ec839a4aa785fbc2dc537c3d58.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 90 + 91 + 92 + \\cdots + 98 + 99&amp;= 90 + (90 + 1) + (90 + 2) + \\cdots + (90 + 8) + (90 + 9) \\\\ &amp;= 90 \\cdot 10 + (1 + 2 + ... + 8 + 9) \\\\ &amp;= 900 + \\frac{9\\cdot 10}{2} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 945}\\end{align*}\" width=\"650\" height=\"122\" />\n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a> (Minor edits)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewrite this sum as: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96aec90f23b86dce3af33ce18c218e4f26cbb9d3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 90 + 91 + \\cdots + 98 + 99&amp;= (100 - 10) + (100 - 9) + \\cdots + (100 - 2) + (100 - 1) \\\\ &amp;= 100 \\cdot 10 - (10 + 9 + ... + 2 + 1) \\\\ &amp;= 1000 - \\frac{10 \\cdot 11}{2} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 945}\\end{align*}\" width=\"615\" height=\"122\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Arithmetic_Series_Formula.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Arithmetic_Series_Formula)\">Solution 4 (Arithmetic Series Formula)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Arithmetic Series Formula)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that the sum of an arithmetic series is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/d/63dff7eb695e96793ecb199d303a2b13f7beaade.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{2} (a_1+a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"34\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is the number of terms, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> is the first term and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> is the last term.\n</p><p>Therefore, the sum of this series is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/3310fa14af5294ad00cde8191ae66c0822991f09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{2}(90+99)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 945}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"193\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Difference_of_Triangular_Numbers.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Difference_of_Triangular_Numbers)\">Solution 5 (Difference of Triangular Numbers)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Difference of Triangular Numbers)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that this expression is the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> positive integers minus the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e609f93104b193a2355181ca62ff083ea9fd3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$89$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> positive integers, that is,  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/7/1277fb1fd58d0646cc77d50ed30fb7310cf6ccad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{99\\cdot100}{2} - \\frac{89\\cdot90}{2} = 4950 - 4005 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 945}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"356\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cxsmi\">cxsmi</a>\n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a> (Minor edit)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Answer_Choices.2C_Estimation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Answer_Choices,_Estimation)\">Solution 6 (Answer Choices, Estimation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Answer Choices, Estimation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since all the terms are between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, the sum must be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/9/a5903afa1770f8aa97108ad2e09d480b1777e63b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\cdot 90 = 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a9746fd53f9f4be1692226ad350172c7223c129e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\cdot 100 = 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"14\" />. Only  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f314c9b184c89a8bfa64760653ef4520c3ed861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 945}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"74\" height=\"30\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_7_.28Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7_(Brute_Force)\">Solution 7 (Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7 (Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding all the terms yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f314c9b184c89a8bfa64760653ef4520c3ed861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 945}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"74\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~ lovelearning999 ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a> (Minor edits)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain!\">Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8bVNfa-yEoM\">https://youtu.be/8bVNfa-yEoM</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1NtsgKc6mXs\">https://youtu.be/1NtsgKc6mXs</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017003732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 205/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4858/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.392      1 -total\n 58.64%    7.267      1 Template:AJHSME_box\n 39.59%    4.906      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7641:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017003732 and revision id 281253. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}